      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OTTO ROSE (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (29.98) at Sandown in a Grade 4/5. Key player on best and worth another chance. LINDENOW BUFFY (2) flew the lids from the middle with a slick turn of foot and stuck on well despite missing the frame, finishing fifth over 510m this track in 28.96. Should be about the money. ENGELKE ROAD (1) was in the money last time at Traralgon (33.37) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 1.5 lengths third. Has three wins already from this draw. With even luck and a clean start can sneak into the finish. SPIRALLING (8) deserves plenty of thought at his first run at this circuit.",
